  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { } \\alpha^2+\\beta^2=(\\alpha+\\beta)^2-2 \\alpha \\beta \\\\ & =(a-2)^2+2(a+1) \\\\ & =a^2-2 a+6=(a-1)^2+5\\end{aligned}$"
